          "snippet": {
            "line": 148,
            "text": "theorem normal_baseAction (β ρ F : ℝ) (B : Frame) (g : Plane) (x y : ℝ) :\n    ⟪normal β ρ B, baseAction F g (tangent ρ B x y)⟫_ℝ =\n      β * ((2 * F * (1 + ρ ^ 2) * (B 0) 0 + ⟪B 0, g⟫_ℝ) * x -\n        2 * F * ρ * (B 1) 0 * y)"
